      "text": "细节：如果一个进程出现异常了，退出码有意义吗？？",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "细节：如果一个进程出现异常了，退出码有意义吗？？",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
